{
  "_doc": "环境电器品类字段表（除湿机/加湿器/蒸发式冷风扇；2026-10-27 从 home 拆出）。结构性特点：带市电、无屏幕主体字段；核心参数是除湿量/加湿量/水箱容量/风量，官网口径分别为 L/D（高温除湿量）、mL/h（额定加湿量）、L、m³/h。除湿量只取官网原文数值（工况标注 30℃/80%RH 由原文承担），不做单位换算、不估算。",
  "version": 1,
  "fields": [
    {
      "path": "climate.type",
      "label": "产品类型",
      "unit": null,
      "type": "string",
      "range": null,
      "dir": null,
      "quantifiable": false,
      "group": "climate",
      "note": "由官方商品名/官网「类型」判定（除湿机 / 加湿器 / 净化加湿器 / 冷风扇）"
    },
    {
      "path": "climate.dehumidifyLpd",
      "label": "高温除湿量",
      "unit": "L/D",
      "type": "number",
      "range": [
        1,
        120
      ],
      "dir": "high",
      "quantifiable": true,
      "group": "climate",
      "note": "官网「高温除湿量 22L/D(30℃/80%RH)」取数值 22；工况由原文承担"
    },
    {
      "path": "climate.dehumidifyNominalKgph",
      "label": "名义除湿量",
      "unit": "kg/h",
      "type": "number",
      "range": [
        0.05,
        6
      ],
      "dir": "high",
      "quantifiable": true,
      "group": "climate",
      "note": "官网「名义除湿量 0.45kg/h(27℃/60%RH)」取数值；与高温除湿量是不同工况口径，分列不合算"
    },
    {
      "path": "climate.humidifyMlph",
      "label": "额定加湿量",
      "unit": "mL/h",
      "type": "number",
      "range": [
        50,
        5000
      ],
      "dir": "high",
      "quantifiable": true,
      "group": "climate",
      "note": "官网「额定加湿量 2600mL/h」取数值"
    },
    {
      "path": "climate.tankL",
      "label": "水箱容量",
      "unit": "L",
      "type": "number",
      "range": [
        0.5,
        40
      ],
      "dir": "high",
      "quantifiable": true,
      "group": "climate",
      "note": "官网「水箱容量/额定水箱容量」取数值"
    },
    {
      "path": "climate.airflowM3h",
      "label": "风量",
      "unit": "m³/h",
      "type": "number",
      "range": [
        20,
        2000
      ],
      "dir": "high",
      "quantifiable": true,
      "group": "climate",
      "note": "官网「风量 140m³/h」取数值；冷风扇/除湿机共有"
    },
    {
